  "notes": "Grayscale, near-desktop look: there's no brand colour, and grey #323232 text sits on #f5f5f5/#fff. Axis bars are long pill-shaped rounded wells (radius 12–18px), each holding small rounded chips with inline icon actions (toggle totals, move ‹ ›, delete). The pivot grid uses ditto marks (〃) instead of blank or repeated parent labels, separated by hairline grid lines with a heavier divider between row headers and data, and a bold Total row. Toolbar counters (15 rows, 13 columns) show grid size. The whole query state, including filters and sidebar pin, is serialized into a base64 URL hash. The Attributes tab lists derived fields (year/quarter/month…) under each column with add-to-rows/columns/cells/filter icon buttons."
